OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1787747175
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Ironing board' seats to be
OL,4,Areplaced on Thameslink
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the work, set to begin in 2027
OL,7,Fand last two years, was "public
OL,8,Fownership of our railways in action" as
OL,9,Fpart of the new Great British Railways
OL,10,Fprogramme.
OL,12,FHowever, some have criticised how the
OL,13,FDepartment for Transport (DfT) awarded
OL,14,Fa #1.6bn contract for the trains
OL,15,Fdespite being warned of the seat
OL,16,Fdiscomfort at the time.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
